c SATLIB-shaped UNSAT fixture (#83): same formula as unit_unsat.cnf, plus the
c two-line `%` / `0` trailer. The SAT counterpart is the load-bearing one --
c the phantom empty clause turns SAT into UNSAT, so a wrong verdict there
c would be masked. This side pins that the trailer does not perturb a real
c refutation either.
p cnf 1 2
1 0
-1 0
%
0
